# Repository scope

This repository implements **only**:

- `apps/web` — React frontend
- `services/membership` — trusted invite/membership service

Foundry Ontology, Actions, Functions, object security, and the generated OSDK are **specified** in `docs/product-decisions.md` and `docs/ontology-spec.md`. They are **not implemented in this repo**. Do not add Foundry project files, generated SDK packages, or Ontology definitions here.

New documentation about this repo (UI, hosting, membership HTTP, local prototyping) belongs in `docs/this-repo/`, not in the Foundry ontology spec.
